   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A task = where + how   (design, not built)",
   "originalText": "A task = where + how   (design, not built)",
   "fontSize": 24,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "index": "b23"
  },
  {
   "id": "t129",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1130,
   "y": 745,
   "width": 403.2,
   "height": 437.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": "f127",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1943375389,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1375876541,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Task {\n  id,\n  goal:       Stop | Pose { x, y, yaw? }   where\n              | Gps { lat, lon, heading? }\n              + tolerance (m)\n  controller: \"dwa\"                       how\n  params:     { horizon: 2.0, ... }\n  planner:    None | \"hybrid_astar\"\n}\n\nPERSISTENT: only a human replaces or\nclears a task. Same id = update: swap the\ncontroller while moving, goal kept.\n\ntask/status: Idle \u00b7 Running \u00b7 Reached \u00b7 Paused\n  NeedsAttention(timeout | stuck | estop |\n    pose lost | restarted ...) \u2192 hold still,\n    goal kept until a human acts\n  Reached + pushed out \u2192 drives back\n    (controller's returns_to_goal)\ntask/cmd:    Resume \u00b7 Pause \u00b7 Clear\n\nGps goal \u2192 converted to Pose with the\nestimator's GPS anchor, unless the\ncontroller lists goals: [Gps]",
   "originalText": "Task {\n  id,\n  goal:       Stop | Pose { x, y, yaw? }   where\n              | Gps { lat, lon, heading? }\n              + tolerance (m)\n  controller: \"dwa\"                       how\n  params:     { horizon: 2.0, ... }\n  planner:    None | \"hybrid_astar\"\n}\n\nPERSISTENT: only a human replaces or\nclears a task. Same id = update: swap the\ncontroller while moving, goal kept.\n\ntask/status: Idle \u00b7 Running \u00b7 Reached \u00b7 Paused\n  NeedsAttention(timeout | stuck | estop |\n    pose lost | restarted ...) \u2192 hold still,\n    goal kept until a human acts\n  Reached + pushed out \u2192 drives back\n    (controller's returns_to_goal)\ntask/cmd:    Resume \u00b7 Pause \u00b7 Clear\n\nGps goal \u2192 converted to Pose with the\nestimator's GPS anchor, unless the\ncontroller lists goals: [Gps]",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "index": "b24"
  },
