   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1  planning/local/my_ctrl.rs\n     impl LocalPlanner for MyCtrl\n2  one ControllerSpec in controllers():\n     id, version, params[], build()\n3  rebuild the rover \u2192 it shows up in\n     Capabilities \u2192 UI dropdown + form\n\nNo rebuild: pick \"remote\" and answer\nremote/state with remote/cmd from any\nlanguage (1 s lease; prototyping only)",
   "originalText": "1  planning/local/my_ctrl.rs\n     impl LocalPlanner for MyCtrl\n2  one ControllerSpec in controllers():\n     id, version, params[], build()\n3  rebuild the rover \u2192 it shows up in\n     Capabilities \u2192 UI dropdown + form\n\nNo rebuild: pick \"remote\" and answer\nremote/state with remote/cmd from any\nlanguage (1 s lease; prototyping only)",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
