   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 82094075,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1  E-stop     phone or remote (latched);\n              SafetyGate zeroes the twist\n2  No pose    target 0, measured None\n3  Bad task   rejected; current task untouched\n4  Attention  timeout / stuck / estop \u2192 hold\n              still; goal stays for a human\n5  Link lost  teleop / remote/cmd expire after\n              1 s \u2192 twist 0. Autonomous tasks\n              keep going until Reached\n6  Config     invalid toml \u2192 every tick stops\n7  Stale      target age > 0.3 s \u2192 stop\n8  BLE gap    no command for 0.25 s \u2192 neutral",
   "originalText": "1  E-stop     phone or remote (latched);\n              SafetyGate zeroes the twist\n2  No pose    target 0, measured None\n3  Bad task   rejected; current task untouched\n4  Attention  timeout / stuck / estop \u2192 hold\n              still; goal stays for a human\n5  Link lost  teleop / remote/cmd expire after\n              1 s \u2192 twist 0. Autonomous tasks\n              keep going until Reached\n6  Config     invalid toml \u2192 every tick stops\n7  Stale      target age > 0.3 s \u2192 stop\n8  BLE gap    no command for 0.25 s \u2192 neutral",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "index": "b28"
  },
